      "title": "BURUNDI: Roads topologic indicators by province",
      "description": "The layer contains two topologic indicators computed on the nodes (roads intersections and dead-ends) of the OpenStreetMap (OSM) drivable roads dataset: i) Betweenness Centrality, and ii) Current Flow Betweenness Centrality. The data has been computed separately on each province of Burundi, then merged on the same file. [Source: This metadata record was automatically extracted from the GeoNode portal eurac]",
